  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section style="background:#F5E6D8;padding:88px 28px;">
    <div style="max-width:880px;margin:0 auto;">
      <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:52px;">
        <div style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C9653F;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:14px;">{{ section.settings.eyebrow }}</div>
        <h2 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:40px;margin:0 0 14px;color:#6B3D42;">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#4a3a30;max-width:48ch;margin:0 auto;">{{ section.settings.subhead }}</p>
      </div>

      <div style="border-top:1px solid rgba(107,61,66,0.2);">
        {%- for i in (1..9) -%}
          {%- assign qk = 'q' | append: i -%}
          {%- assign ak = 'a' | append: i -%}
          {%- assign q = section.settings[qk] -%}
          {%- assign a = section.settings[ak] -%}
          {%- if q != blank -%}
          <div style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(107,61,66,0.2);">
            <button data-wk-faq="{{ i }}" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;background:none;border:none;text-align:left;padding:24px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;">
              <span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:21px;color:#6B3D42;line-height:1.3;">{{ q }}</span>
              <span style="font-size:22px;color:#C9653F;font-weight:300;flex:0 0 auto;">+</span>
            </button>
            <div class="wk-panel" data-wk-faq-panel="{{ i }}" style="display:{% if forloop.first %}block{% else %}none{% endif %};">
              <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4a3a30;margin:0 0 24px;max-width:66ch;">{{ a }}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "WK - FAQ",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Questions, answered" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "The honest answers" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "subhead", "label": "Subheading", "default": "No spin, no over-promising. If something isn't here, our team reads every message." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Q1" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "q1", "label": "Question", "default": "I'm not sure I'm in perimenopause yet — is this for me?" },
    { "type": "inline_richtext", "id": "a1", "label": "Answer", "default": "Most likely, yes. Perimenopause can begin in your early forties — often years before the word menopause feels like it belongs to you. If you're noticing changes in sleep, mood, bloating, or temperature and a doctor has told you your labs are \"normal,\" this formula was built for exactly that window.*" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Q2" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "q2", "label": "Question", "default": "Does it contain hormones?" },
    { "type": "inline_richtext", "id": "a2", "label": "Answer", "default": "No. There is no estrogen, progesterone, or any hormone in this formula. It works through named botanicals, vitamins, and a probiotic blend that support your body's own systems — including the estrobolome — rather than adding hormones to them.*" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Q3" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "q3", "label": "Question", "default": "How is this different from a multivitamin or other menopause supplements?" },
    { "type": "inline_richtext", "id": "a3", "label": "Answer", "default": "Most of the category hides behind proprietary blends and fairy-dust doses. We name and dose every active at the level the research actually used — 200mg ashwagandha, 100mg standardised black cohosh, 100mg red clover isoflavones, and a 10 billion CFU probiotic blend. You can read exactly what you're taking, and how much, on the panel." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Q4" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "q4", "label": "Question", "default": "How do I take it?" },
    { "type": "inline_richtext", "id": "a4", "label": "Answer", "default": "Two gummies daily, with or without food, at a time you'll remember — there's no loading phase and no routine to build your day around. Consistency matters more than timing, so pick a moment that sticks. Each bottle is 60 gummies, a full 30-day supply at the two-a-day serving." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Q5" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "q5", "label": "Question", "default": "When will I notice a difference?" },
    { "type": "inline_richtext", "id": "a5", "label": "Answer", "default": "Many women report steadier sleep and a calmer stress response within two to three weeks. Bloating and mood often follow by week four, with the fuller picture — cooler nights, steadier days — by weeks six to eight as the actives reach steady state. Consistency matters more than timing.*" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Q6" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "q6", "label": "Question", "default": "Can I take it alongside my medications or other supplements?" },
    { "type": "inline_richtext", "id": "a6", "label": "Answer", "default": "Because every ingredient and dose is on the label, you and your clinician can review it in full. Some botanicals — black cohosh and chasteberry among them — can interact with certain medications or conditions, so please check with your healthcare provider before starting, especially if you are taking medication, are pregnant, or are nursing." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Q7" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "q7", "label": "Question", "default": "Is it really sugar-free — and what does it taste like?" },
    { "type": "inline_richtext", "id": "a7", "label": "Answer", "default": "Yes — no added sugar and no sugar alcohols that upset the gut. The gummy is a deep-red cranberry, lightly tart rather than candy-sweet, designed to be a daily you actually look forward to without working against the formula's gut support." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Q8" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "q8", "label": "Question", "default": "What is the estrobolome, and why does it matter?" },
    { "type": "inline_richtext", "id": "a8", "label": "Answer", "default": "It's the community of gut bacteria that helps metabolise estrogen. When it falls out of balance — as it often does in the transition — recirculating estrogen can swing, feeding bloating, mood shifts, and disrupted sleep. Our probiotic blend supports that gut–hormone conversation, so the rest of the formula has steadier ground to work on.*" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Q9" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "q9", "label": "Question", "default": "How does the subscription work, and what if it's not for me?" },
    { "type": "inline_richtext", "id": "a9", "label": "Answer", "default": "Your subscription ships free on your chosen cadence, and you can pause, skip, or cancel anytime from your account — no emails, no hoops. And because the formula needs a full transition cycle to show what it can do, every order is backed by our 90-day money-back guarantee: take the whole three months, and if it isn't right for you, reach out for a full refund — no need to return the bottles." }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
